# Shopping Cart Dashboard

A full-stack Shopping Cart Dashboard built using **Node.js, Express.js, MongoDB, JWT authentication, and Bootstrap**.

The application provides role-based access for **Admin** and **Normal Users**.

---

#Features

### Admin

* View shopping list
* Add new products
* View all users
* Add new users (Admin or Normal)

### Normal User

* Register account
* Login
* View shopping list

---

#Tech Stack

Backend

* Node.js
* Express.js
* MongoDB
* JWT Authentication
* bcrypt password hashing

Frontend

* HTML
* Bootstrap
* JavaScript

---

