# Installation

### 1️⃣ Clone the repository

```
git clone https://github.com/your-username/shopping-cart-dashboard.git
```

### 2️⃣ Navigate to project

```
cd shopping-cart-dashboard
```

### 3️⃣ Install dependencies

```
npm install
```

### 4️⃣ Create .env file

```
PORT=5000
MONGO_URI=your_mongodb_connection_string
JWT_SECRET=your_secret_key
```

### 5️⃣ Run the server

```
node server.js
```

or

```
npm run dev
```

Server runs at:

```
http://localhost:5000
```

---

# 🌐 Frontend URLs

| Page        | URL                                   |
| ----------- | ------------------------------------- |
| Login       | http://localhost:5000/login.html      |
| Register    | http://localhost:5000/register.html   |
| Dashboard   | http://localhost:5000/dashboard.html  |
| Add Product | http://localhost:5000/addProduct.html |
| User List   | http://localhost:5000/users.html      |

---

# 🔗 API Endpoints

### Authentication

Register User

```
POST /api/auth/register
```

Login

```
POST /api/auth/login
```

---

### Products

Get Products

```
GET /api/products
```

Add Product (Admin only)

```
POST /api/products/add
```

---

### Users

Get All Users (Admin)

```
GET /api/users
```

Add User (Admin)

```
POST /api/users/add
```

---

# 🔐 Authentication

Protected APIs require JWT token.

Example header:

```
Authorization: Bearer <token>
```

---

# 🧪 API Testing

APIs can be tested using:

* Postman
* Thunder Client (VS Code)

Testing flow:

1 Register user
2 Login user
3 Copy JWT token
4 Test product APIs
5 Test admin APIs

---

# 👨‍💻 Admin Setup

The first admin user must be inserted manually in the database.

Example document:

```
{
"name":"Admin",
"email":"admin@gmail.com",
"password":"bcrypt_hashed_password",
"role":"admin"
}
```

